Your Chronos trial ends on {{datetime .TrialEndsAt}}.

There is no card on the account, so when the trial ends your organisation will
be suspended: nobody will be able to sign in to it. Nothing is deleted, and
nothing is charged. Adding a card restores access immediately, whether you do it
before the trial ends or afterwards.

Add a card from Billing in your organisation settings.
